> For some reason level 23 had a lot of
> rock trolls, some from a throne room.

> Any suggestions on what others do to troll corpses?

I usually try to dump troll corpses in a chest and lock it until they
decompose.  If there's lots of trolls I find I can usually unlock the
chest, dump the next corpse in, and lock it again.  Sometimes,
however, a troll in the chest chooses that very turn to respawn.
Mostly I get away with it though.  Throne rooms have the advantage of
having a guaranteed chest.

The disadvantage of this method is that you spend a few turns
overtaxed, so you might be at risk from fast monsters and the like.
But, as you found out, eating the corpses is not without its risks
either.

Of course, the alternative is just to leave the level.  You probably
won't be spending too many more turns there on the way up anyway.

